+# test/corim
+
+`attestation-bench-corim-milan.cbor` is, byte for byte, the CoRIM the attestation-bench trust zone provisions this
+scheme with (`trust/veraison-corim-milan.cbor` there, sha256
+`77c4da9cec5c9213a8b5a8f9522cbafe7dc8c3cd762172dcc3d421040042166d`). It holds one CoMID with AMD's ARK-Milan as the
+trust anchor and one reference-value CoMID for each approved SEV-SNP launch, on Google Cloud and on AWS, made on
+28 September 2026 by go-gen-ref's ReportToComid from SEV-SNP reports of those launches (`hwcheck/cmd/mkcorim`).
+
+The other files are upstream's.
