+++ b/scheme/sevsnp/test/evidence/SOURCES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# test/evidence
+
+`sevsnp-gcp-tsm-report.cbor` is, byte for byte, the TSM report token of the honest Enrollment Evidence (present-nonce)
+of an attestation-bench hardware run on Google Cloud (n2d-standard-2, Milan) on 7 October 2026, as the guest made it
+through configfs-tsm: `hwcheck/evidence/20261007T134801Z-gcp-sev-snp/enroll-present-nonce/evidence.tsm.cbor` there,
+sha256 `ddc3306caf7fd898cf38b41c81cf528aa21959e8cbceb55e0e3c5593d939605a`. The report is signed with the chip's VCEK,
+and the host's certificate table holds DER entries. Its REPORT_DATA is the run's binding value (`binding_value_hex` in
+the run's `enroll-present-nonce/meta.json`).
+
+`sevsnp-vlek-tsm-report.cbor` is described in `scheme_vlek_test.go`; the other files are upstream's.
